sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Depositor
    participant V as Vault — ERC-7540
    participant P as TranchePipeModule
    participant H as TrancheJITHook
    participant A as LendingPool — rest state
    participant C as TrancheAccountant

    U->>V: depositUSDC(usdcAmount, receiver)
    V->>V: transferFrom USDC · check expired / paused / cap
    V->>P: wrapUSDC(usdcAmount, vault)
    P->>H: wrapUSDC(usdcAmount, vault)
    H->>H: mint hook shares — ERC-7575 virtual-share conversion
    H->>A: supply idle USDC into rest state
    H-->>P: hook shares
    P-->>V: hook shares
    V->>V: mint vault shares to receiver
    V->>C: onTrancheDeposit(isSenior, hookShares)
    C->>C: update tranche principal and entitlements
    V-->>U: Deposit + UsdcDeposited events

    Note over V,C: ERC-7540 async path: requestDeposit → claimable → deposit(assets) syncs the same wrap flow
    Note over H,A: Equity never leaves the hook — it sits in Aave as aTokenEquity when configured
